#: daemon/gdm-legacy-display.c:236
msgid ""
"Could not start the X server (your graphical environment) due to an internal "
"error. Please contact your system administrator or check your syslog to "
"diagnose. In the meantime this display will be disabled.  Please restart GDM "
"when the problem is corrected."
msgstr ""
"Skuli wewnyntrznego błyndu niy idzie sztartnōńć serwera X (twōj interfejs "
"graficzny). Skōntaktuj sie ze administratorym systymu abo zdiagnozuj problym "
"podle zawartości dziynnikōw systymu. Ekran bydzie tymczasowo zastawiōny. Po "
"sprawiyniu problymu ôtwōrz na nowo GDM."

